users: Roster ng mga residente, garbage collectors, at administrators.
schedules: Waste segregation pickup days, time slots, at zone assignments.
reports: Citizen incident reports (Missed collection, illegal dumping, overflowing bins) kalakip ang photo evidence at resolution timestamps.
announcements: Municipal MENRO advisories at holiday reminders.
routes: Collector routes, truck fleet IDs, live GPS coordinates, at checkpoint progress.
notifications: Push at in-app alerts para sa bawat residente at kolektor.
collection_logs: Pang-araw-araw na tala ng nakolektang basura at estimated tonnage.
Bagong Feature: Interactive Database Inspector & Control Center
Pumunta sa Admin tab (Users & PDF).
Makikita mo ang SQLite Room Database card na may live counter ng lahat ng tables.
Pindutin ang "Inspect Schema" upang makita ang detalye ng tables at relasyon ng data.
Gamitin ang "Re-seed DB" upang ma-synchronize o ma-reset ang database anumang oras.
2. Database para sa Upamate – Boarding House & Dorm Finder
(Para sa nakalakip mong file na upamate_-boarding-house-&-dorm-finder.zip)
Kung nais mong lagyan ng database ang Upamate (Boarding House & Dormitory Finder para sa mga estudyante at boarders), narito ang kumpletong Database Schema at Room Database Code:
A. Database Schema Structure
users: ID, buong pangalan, email, contact number, role (STUDENT, LANDLORD, ADMIN).
boarding_houses: Pangalan ng dorm, address, coordinates (lat/lng), gender restrictions (MALE_ONLY, FEMALE_ONLY, CO_ED), buwanang presyo, contact info.
rooms: Room number, bed slots, available slots, aircon/fan, presyo kada kama.
amenities: WiFi, sariling CR, cooking allowed, laundry area, CCTV, study hall.
bookings_inquiries: Tenant ID, dorm ID, room ID, inquiry message, status (PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, RESERVED).
reviews: Rating (1–5 stars), review feedback, petsa.
B. Room Database Entities & DAO para sa Upamate
Paano I-apply:
Kung nais mong ilipat o i-convert ang applet na ito patungong Upamate: I-confirm lamang dito at gagawin nating buong Dorm Finder app ang project kalakip ang Room database at Jetpack Compose screens.
